{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13726","headline":"赠别崔十三长官 · 顾况","name":"赠别崔十三长官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真玉烧不热，宝剑拗不折。\n欲别崔侠心，崔侠心如铁。\n复如金刚锁，无有功不彻。\n仍於直道中，行事不诋讦。\n崔侠两兄弟，垂范继芳烈。\n相识三十年，致书字不灭。\n我来宣城郡，饮水仰清洁。\n蔼蔼北阜松，峩峩南山雪。\n顾生归山去，知作几年别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}